    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.poster.avif?t=1667062313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.webm?t=1667062313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.mp4?t=1667062313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/8545d6481c4ef3747eba1c81c16b6954.avif?t=1667062313\" /></div><br><br>Discover Prosperity, a huge island of 4*4km with its beautiful cities and countryside full of opportunities!<br><br>There is a lot of ways to explore prosperity:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Take a walk in our cities to make some shopping, or simply talk with the other players around<br></li><li> Go on a road trip with your car or bike and explore the countryside<br></li><li> Enjoy the view from our unique aerial subway</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/c49e193c2119ab152b0a52cc681a24d2.avif?t=1667062313\" /></div><br><br>Socialize is a non-linear, multiplayer role-playing game, where we give you the tools to find your own ways of making money, you can for example :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gather resources and sell them &quot;as-is&quot;<br></li><li> Transform your resources into more valuable products and sell them to shops or other players<br></li><li> Sell your services (car driving, protection, anything you can think of) to other players <br></li><li> Enroll yourself in the Police forces to fight against criminals<br></li><li> Try to become rich doing buisness activities (sell items, become a politican, or heist the bank!)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/8f0fd824e7152515fdfea10487e9e566.avif?t=1667062313\" /></div><br><br>Socialize is not just another generic MMORPG like we always see. We don't have a mega server, with all the players having the same experience. Instead, we give you the tools to create your own role-playing server and join unique communities with their own vision of what roleplaying should be!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.poster.avif?t=1667062313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.webm?t=1667062313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/879c9095da54cf8b831f242c1ade4eef.mp4?t=1667062313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/8545d6481c4ef3747eba1c81c16b6954.avif?t=1667062313\" /></div><br><br>Discover Prosperity, a huge island of 4*4km with its beautiful cities and countryside full of opportunities!<br><br>There is a lot of ways to explore prosperity:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Take a walk in our cities to make some shopping, or simply talk with the other players around<br></li><li> Go on a road trip with your car or bike and explore the countryside<br></li><li> Enjoy the view from our unique aerial subway</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/c49e193c2119ab152b0a52cc681a24d2.avif?t=1667062313\" /></div><br><br>Socialize is a non-linear, multiplayer role-playing game, where we give you the tools to find your own ways of making money, you can for example :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gather resources and sell them &quot;as-is&quot;<br></li><li> Transform your resources into more valuable products and sell them to shops or other players<br></li><li> Sell your services (car driving, protection, anything you can think of) to other players <br></li><li> Enroll yourself in the Police forces to fight against criminals<br></li><li> Try to become rich doing buisness activities (sell items, become a politican, or heist the bank!)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1789170/extras/8f0fd824e7152515fdfea10487e9e566.avif?t=1667062313\" /></div><br><br>Socialize is not just another generic MMORPG like we always see. We don't have a mega server, with all the players having the same experience. Instead, we give you the tools to create your own role-playing server and join unique communities with their own vision of what roleplaying should be!",
    "short_description": "If you're a fan of Altis life, DarkRP, GTAV RP and more, Socialize is the multiplayer role-playing game you've been waiting for! Join a unique community that will fit your vision of roleplaying in this endless living world and write your own story with no limits!",
